-- Fixed Speed Hack (ใช้ Hook และบังคับอัปเดตผ่าน Humanoid และ RenderStepped พร้อมกันเพื่อให้วิ่งเร็วติดชัวร์)
RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function()
    if speedHackState then
        pcall(function()
            local char = LocalPlayer.Character
            if char then
                local humanoid = char:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                local hrp = char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
                if humanoid then
                    humanoid.WalkSpeed = walkSpeedValue
                end
                -- เสริมแรงเคลื่อนที่แนวราบหากแมพหน่วงค่า WalkSpeed
                if hrp and humanoid and humanoid.MoveDirection.Magnitude > 0 then
                    local currentVelocity = hrp.Velocity
                    local moveDir = humanoid.MoveDirection
                    hrp.Velocity = Vector3.new(moveDir.X * walkSpeedValue, currentVelocity.Y, moveDir.Z * walkSpeedValue)
                end
            end
        end)
    end
end)

-- Background Loop: Auto Kill All
RunService.Stepped:Connect(function()
    if autoKillAllState then
        pcall(function()
            local damageEvent = getACSCombatEvent()
            local character = LocalPlayer.Character
            if damageEvent and character and character:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") then
                local myRootPart = character.HumanoidRootPart
                for _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
                    if player ~= LocalPlayer and player.Character then
                        local targetChar = player.Character
                        local humanoid = targetChar:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
                        local targetPart = targetChar:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or targetChar:FindFirstChild("Head")
                        if humanoid and humanoid.Health > 0 and targetPart then
                            local args = {
                                [1] = {
                                    filterDescendants = {
                                        [1] = character,
                                        [2] = Workspace:FindFirstChild("Camera") and Workspace.Camera:FindFirstChild("Viewmodel") or Workspace
                                    },
                                    origin = myRootPart.Position,
                                    shellMaxDist = 9999,
                                    shellName = "DefaultMelee",
                                    shellSpeed = 500,
                                    shellType = "Melee",
                                    weaponName = "Knife"
                                },
                                [2] = humanoid,
                                [3] = 999999,
                                [4] = 2,
                                [5] = targetPart,
                                n = 5
                            }
                            damageEvent:InvokeServer(table.unpack(args, 1, 5))
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end)
    end
end)

